{"id": "t006-001", "text": "Khadija's mum is having her hip replaced on May 14. Khadija is taking the week off to look after her and sounded pretty worn out about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her hip replaced", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty worn out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t006-005", "text": "Sadia's dad was admitted to hospital last night with chest pains. They're keeping him in until at least Thursday while they run more tests, and her brother Imran is driving down from Leeds tomorrow to sit with him. Sadia is trying to hold it together for her mum, who hasn't left the ward since. I should call her tomorrow morning before her shift and ask if there's anything they need dropping off.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "admitted to hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until at least Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imran", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down from Leeds", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to hold it together", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning before her shift", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if there's anything they need dropping off", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t006-008", "text": "Lwazi said his brother Thabo had his appendix out on Sunday. He's home now and recovering well, but can't drive for a few weeks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had his appendix out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t006-009", "text": "Gintaras is vegetarian and doesn't drink. His wife Irina is from Vilnius, and they have two girls, both at primary school.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Vilnius", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "have two girls", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "both at primary school", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t006-015", "text": "Asha had her follow-up with the consultant this morning. All clear, which is such a relief after the last few months. Must send her flowers this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follow-up with the consultant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "All clear", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the last few months"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-018", "text": "Farid is a structural engineer at Arup. He's originally from Tehran but has lived in Glasgow since he was twelve.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "structural engineer at Arup", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "originally from Tehran", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lived in Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since he was twelve"}]}
{"id": "t006-019", "text": "Blessing's mum, Mrs Okafor, is in for a cataract operation on August 5th at 2pm. Blessing is driving her in and staying with her for the evening. Remind me to check in with Blessing the day after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Okafor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract operation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 5th at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with Blessing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-021", "text": "Sofia's grandmother passed away on Saturday. The funeral is on October 30 at 11am in Seville, and Sofia flies out on the 28th. Her brother Diego is going with her, but her dad can't travel because of his back. She said her abuela basically raised her during the summers. I need to message her before she leaves and maybe send something to the family.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 30 at 11am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Diego", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't travel because of his back", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "abuela", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "basically raised her", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "during the summers"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she leaves", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something to the family", "owner": "r4", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t006-026", "text": "Karim had a minor stroke last week and is at the Royal Free until Monday. His daughter Layla is keeping everyone updated. Must visit him at the weekend, probably Sunday at 2pm when visiting opens.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "minor stroke", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "visit him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 2pm when visiting opens", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-031", "text": "Long call with Khadija tonight. Her brother Yusuf is back in hospital, this time for an infection after his operation on April 20. Her mum is staying with him most days, and Khadija is covering the school runs for his kids. She's exhausted and said she hasn't slept properly in a week. I should offer to take the kids one afternoon, maybe Thursday after school, and check in with her on Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "infection", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "April 20", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "covering the school runs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to take the kids", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday after school", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t006-033", "text": "Mateo's mum, Mrs Gonzalez, is turning seventy on June 21st. There's a family lunch at their place at 1pm. I'm bringing dessert.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Gonzalez", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning seventy", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 21st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "family lunch at their place", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "1pm", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t006-037", "text": "Spoke to Arjun after his interview at Google. He thinks it went well, though the system design round threw him a bit. His wife Priya is convinced he's got it. He should hear back by Friday afternoon, and if it's a yes he'd start in January. Text him Friday evening to see if he's heard anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at Google", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Priya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hear back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "start", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-038", "text": "Akira and Noor are hosting a housewarming on Saturday the 15th from 6pm. They've finally finished the kitchen.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 15th from 6pm", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t006-039", "text": "Irina said her father has early dementia. They're looking at care homes near Kaunas but her mum is resisting it and wants to keep him at home. Irina is flying over on November 8 for a week to visit two places with her sister. She's finding it all very hard and feels guilty being so far away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "father", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "early dementia", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to keep him at home", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "finding it all very hard", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "guilty", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t006-044", "text": "Remind me to call Ahmed's dad on Wednesday at noon. He's home from hospital after his bypass and Ahmed asked if I'd check on him while he's away.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Ahmed's dad", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at noon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bypass", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's away", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-045", "text": "Farid and Blessing are getting married on 8/16 at a barn near Stroud. Ceremony is at 2pm and the reception goes on until midnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8/16", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until midnight", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t006-048", "text": "Vera's operation went fine yesterday. She's sore but already bored of the ward and complaining about the food. Her son is visiting this evening after work. They might discharge her Friday morning if her bloods are okay. I should drop off some books and her favourite chocolate before then, probably Thursday at lunchtime.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sore", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bored of the ward", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this evening after work"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "discharge her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some books and her favourite chocolate", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at lunchtime", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-049", "text": "Weekly shop, then gym at 6. Nothing else on today.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Weekly shop", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "6", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}]}
{"id": "t006-050", "text": "Miriam's daughter Hannah graduates from Durham on July 1st at 10:30am. Miriam, her husband and both grandmothers are going up the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from Durham", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 1st at 10:30am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmothers", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t006-052", "text": "Adaeze had her gallbladder removed on Monday. Her husband said the surgery went well but she's in quite a bit of pain. Send her a message tomorrow afternoon to see how she's doing, and ask if they need any meals.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had her gallbladder removed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in quite a bit of pain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if they need any meals", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t006-054", "text": "Imani's mum and dad are flying in from Nairobi on December 18 and staying until early January. She's slightly stressed about having them in the flat for that long.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Nairobi", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 18", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until early January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t006-059", "text": "Talked to Zoe, Khadija and Sadia at lunch. Zoe's mum has a hysterectomy on March 3rd and Zoe is staying with her for a fortnight afterwards. Khadija offered to cover her classes. Sadia mentioned her own mum went through the same thing last year and recovered fine. Zoe seemed calmer after hearing that. I should check in with her the week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hysterectomy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "calmer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-060", "text": "Mateo said Marisol has been offered a permanent contract. They're celebrating at her parents' on Sunday lunchtime.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a permanent contract", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebrating", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday lunchtime", "anchor": "e2"}]}
